{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/930434-ex3-using-homebrew-lunars-and-could-use-input-on-something","id":930434,"title":"[Ex3] Using homebrew lunars, and could use input on something","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-12T11:26:06-07:00","id":930434,"title":"[Ex3] Using homebrew lunars, and could use input on something","content":"Ok.<br /> <br /> So I have been using Irked's homebrew lunars for a game to test it out, using chargen i posted in there.<br /> <br /> I have a question to ask the forum however....<br /> <br /> The Strength Excellency.<br /> <br /> Lunar Tiny Tyka has a strength of 4. This allows her to do Strength 3 Feats. She also has the Lunar Strength Excellency. <br /> <br /> Would you say if she spends the motes on it, her strength is treated as however much higher she spent? So if she spent 1, her strength is 5 for the purpose of the feat, or if she spent 3 its 7?<br /> <br /> Or does that break lunars in any way? I mean yeah i guess in theory they could hit that Strength 10 threshold right out of chargen, but so could an athletics supernal solar, and unlike the solar, the lunar probably doesn't have the luxury of &quot;reroll non successes and get double 7s&quot;<br /> <br /> ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12044-chaosarchon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12044_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12044\" data-vbnamecard=\"12044\">ChaosArchon</a>, since this is for YOUR game, I'd like you to weigh in on this as well.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T12:18:10-07:00","id":930463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/930434-ex3-using-homebrew-lunars-and-could-use-input-on-something#post930434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok.<br /> <br /> So I have been using Irked's homebrew lunars for a game to test it out, using chargen i posted in there.<br /> <br /> I have a question to ask the forum however....<br /> <br /> The Strength Excellency.<br /> <br /> Lunar Tiny Tyka has a strength of 4. This allows her to do Strength 3 Feats. She also has the Lunar Strength Excellency.<br /> <br /> Would you say if she spends the motes on it, her strength is treated as however much higher she spent? So if she spent 1, her strength is 5 for the purpose of the feat, or if she spent 3 its 7?<br /> <br /> Or does that break lunars in any way? I mean yeah i guess in theory they could hit that Strength 10 threshold right out of chargen, but so could an athletics supernal solar, and unlike the solar, the lunar probably doesn't have the luxury of &quot;reroll non successes and get double 7s&quot;<br /> <br /> ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12044-chaosarchon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12044_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12044\" data-vbnamecard=\"12044\">ChaosArchon</a>, since this is for YOUR game, I'd like you to weigh in on this as well.)</div> </div> </div> </div>An athletics supernal can only get to 6 strength for general purpose using ISE from chargen as long as she's starting at Essence 1. When it comes to feats of strength, yeah, a solar can get to really high feats of strength out of the gate. I don't think there's anything wrong with a lunar being able to do the same: They're the generalists. When it comes to charms relating to raw attributes: strength, dexterity, appearance, et cetera, the lunar is almost always going to be better than the solar. ISE is frankly kind of...weird.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12025,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12025-praxiscat","user":"PraxisCat","date":". 07-12-2016, 03:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12025-praxiscat","name":"PraxisCat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12025_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T12:33:35-07:00","id":930474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PraxisCat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/930434-ex3-using-homebrew-lunars-and-could-use-input-on-something?p=930463#post930463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> An athletics supernal can only get to 6 strength for general purpose using ISE from chargen as long as she's starting at Essence 1.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh i meant he just flat ignores it.... with Nine Aeons Thew.<br /> <br /> <br /> B