 feats of strength, solars are still pretty wild, operating at the &quot;I will throw this mountain&quot; levels . I was talking mechanically wrt actual strength levels, there's nothing wrong with how you've mathed it out <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I am reminded of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/753738-today-we-throw-a-mountain\">Sol the Mountain Thrower</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T14:17:08-07:00","id":930524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/930434-ex3-using-homebrew-lunars-and-could-use-input-on-something#post930434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok.<br /> <br /> So I have been using Irked's homebrew lunars for a game to test it out, using chargen i posted in there.<br /> <br /> I have a question to ask the forum however....<br /> <br /> The Strength Excellency.<br /> <br /> Lunar Tiny Tyka has a strength of 4. This allows her to do Strength 3 Feats. She also has the Lunar Strength Excellency. <br /> <br /> Would you say if she spends the motes on it, her strength is treated as however much higher she spent? So if she spent 1, her strength is 5 for the purpose of the feat, or if she spent 3 its 7?<br /> <br /> Or does that break lunars in any way? I mean yeah i guess in theory they could hit that Strength 10 threshold right out of chargen, but so could an athletics supernal solar, and unlike the solar, the lunar probably doesn't have the luxury of &quot;reroll non successes and get double 7s&quot;<br /> <br /> ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12044-chaosarchon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12044_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12044\" data-vbnamecard=\"12044\">ChaosArchon</a>, since this is for YOUR game, I'd like you to weigh in on this as well.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the Lunar needs a Charm like Ten Ox Meditation. The Strength Excellency already helps by adding dice.<br /> <br /> The Lunar can also easily raise her effective Strength for feats of strength by shapeshifting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.t